  "title": "Leonardo DRS Schedules First Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call for May 5, 2026",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 6, 2026-- Leonardo DRS, Inc. (Nasdaq: DRS) has scheduled a conference call for Tuesday, May 5, 2026 beginning at 10:00 a.m. (ET) to discuss its first quarter 2026 results. The company plans to issue its quarterly earnings press release prior to the conference",
